outline.description:
Explains construction of a curated instruction dataset comprising ~776k examples covering English problems sourced from GSM8K/MATH/tool-integrated solutions plus MathInstruct/Lila-OOD datasets together with Chinese K–12 problems annotated in both chain-of-thought and tool-integrated formats;
detailing fine-tuning hyperparameters;
and reporting zero-shot/few-shot evaluations demonstrating step-by-step reasoning accuracy exceeding prior open-source baselines.
